#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/no_function_key.md:1
msgid "No Function Key"
msgstr "ファンクションキーなし"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/no_function_key.md:3
msgid ""
"The no-function-key is a key that has no function, only for static displays."
msgstr "no-function-key は、静的表示専用の機能を持たないキーです。"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/no_function_key.md:5
msgid "![1745501941449](image/no_function_key/1745501941449.png)"
msgstr "![1745501941449](image/no_function_key/1745501941449.png)"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/no_function_key.md:5
msgid "1745501941449"
msgstr "1745501941449"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/no_function_key.md:7
msgid "In the FlexDesigner"
msgstr "FlexDesigner で"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/no_function_key.md:9
msgid ""
"Background and foreground settings are available for this just like for a "
"normal key. The function page is blank becuase it has no function."
msgstr "通常のキーと同様に、背景と前景の設定を使用できます。機能ページは機能がないため空白です。"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/no_function_key.md:11
msgid "On the Flexbar"
msgstr "Flexbar 上で"

#: ../../source/functions/placeholder/no_function_key.md:13
msgid ""
"The no-function-key is displayed just like any other keys, but it cannot be "
"pressed."
msgstr "ファンクションなしキーは他のキーと同様に表示されますが、押すことはできません。"
